# Aliyun ARTC SDK for Windows — proprietary binaries / headers; drop the
# unpacked SDK under deploy/edge/windows/vendor/aliyun-artc-windows/ but
# never commit it. The PyInstaller spec globs DLLs from this path at
# build time; absence yields a smoke-test binary that fails at RTC join.
deploy/edge/windows/vendor/aliyun-artc-windows/include/
deploy/edge/windows/vendor/aliyun-artc-windows/x64/
deploy/edge/windows/vendor/aliyun-artc-windows/x86/
